    <item>
      <title>Iruka 0.5.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <html><body style="font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; padding: 12px;">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Iruka 0.5.0</h3>
        <p><strong>New — Licensing</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Personal (3 Macs) and Team (10 Macs) license tiers via LemonSqueezy</li>
          <li>License instance ID stored securely in macOS Keychain</li>
          <li>1-year or 3-year free update windows; renewals stack without losing remaining time</li>
          <li>30-day offline grace period — app works normally without a network connection</li>
          <li>Settings → License shows your tier, machine limit, and update expiry date</li>
          <li>Renewal reminder appears in Settings when your update window is expiring</li>
          <li>Automatic Sparkle update checks suppressed for expired update windows</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Improved — Terminal</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>New <em>Go Here</em> button (↘) sends a one-time cd to the file browser's current folder without changing Sync state</li>
        </ul>
        </body></html>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/dorienh/iruka-releases/releases/download/v0.5.0/Iruka-0.5.0.dmg"
