    <item>
      <title>Iruka 0.4.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <html><body style="font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; padding: 12px;">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Iruka 0.4.0</h3>
        <p><strong>New</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>New File / New Folder now prompt for a name before creating — no inline rename step needed</li>
          <li>Newly created items are automatically selected and scrolled into view</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Fixed</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>⌘Delete (permanent delete) now works reliably from anywhere in the window</li>
          <li>Enter in the ⌘Delete confirmation dialog no longer navigates into the folder</li>
          <li>Terminal typing no longer breaks after clicking a file row</li>
          <li>Column view preview pane is now resizable</li>
        </ul>
        </body></html>
      ]]></description>
